Signed distance functions by Inigo Quilez — MIT License
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Several primitive distance functions in this repository are derived from the
distance-function library published by Inigo Quilez at:

    https://iquilezles.org/articles/distfunctions/

That code is published under the MIT License, which permits commercial use
provided the licence text is included and the source is credited. Both
conditions are met here.

Derived functions, and where each one lives:

    capped cone       PRIMS.cone       sinterform.js  ·  GLSL.cone       glsl.js
    ellipsoid bound   PRIMS.ellipsoid  sinterform.js  ·  GLSL.ellipsoid  glsl.js
    pyramid           PRIMS.pyramid    sinterform.js  ·  GLSL.pyramid    glsl.js
    octahedron        PRIMS.octa       sinterform.js  ·  GLSL.octa       glsl.js
    polygon distance  polygonSDF       sinterform.js  ·  profileDecls    glsl.js
                      polygonSDF       sketch.js
                      polygonSDF       sketch3d.js

Each is adapted rather than copied verbatim — rewritten in JavaScript,
re-parameterised onto this kernel's dimension conventions, or both — but the
method and its derivation are his, and the grant below is what makes that use
lawful.

The remaining primitives (sphere, box, cylinder, capsule, torus, prism, dome,
arc, link, plane, field, profile) are either elementary distance formulae or
were written for this repository.


