A standing note on provenance
================================================================================

Shadertoy's default licence, applied to any shader whose author did not state
otherwise, is CC BY-NC-SA 3.0. The NonCommercial term makes it unusable here
and the ShareAlike term conflicts with Apache-2.0, so a function whose only
provenance is an unlicensed Shadertoy paste cannot go into this repository.

Take distance functions from a source that states its terms — the article above
is the usual one — and add the function and its source to the list above in the
same commit.
